error[E0444]: a deferred 'last' binding needs a type
 --> $DIR/last-without-type.nra:3:10
  |
3 |     last base;
  |          ^^^^ 'base' has neither a type nor a value
  |
help: give it a type and assign it exactly once later
  |
3 |     last base: <type>;
  |              ++++++++
help: or give it its value now
  |
3 |     last base = <value>;
  |              ++++++++++

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0444`.
